# "Target artifact or land an opponent controls": with the mana in the pool, Bot1 cannot target its own Sol Ring or its own
# Mountain, nor Bot2's Llanowar Elves (a creature that is neither artifact nor land). The positive control is Bot2's
# Ornithopter: an artifact (creature) an opponent controls. It is destroyed; Bot2 declines the search, so its library
# keeps its Forest, and Bot1 still draws.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Price of Freedom
Sol Ring
Mountain x3
Mountain
Island
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Forest x4
Forest
Forest x10

